"Stockhorn (STO_6000), {0} m a.s.l., {1} m deep": "Stockhorn (STO_6000), {0} m hoogte, {1} m diep",
"Stockhorn (STO_6100), {0} m a.s.l., {1} m deep": "Stockhorn (STO_6100), {0} m hoogte, {1} m diep",
"Gentianes (GEN_0102), {0} m a.s.l., {1} m deep": "Gentianes (GEN_0102), {0} m hoogte, {1} m diep",
"Ritigraben (RIT_0102), {0} m a.s.l., {1} m deep": "Ritigraben (RIT_0102), {0} m hoogte, {1} m diep",
"Schilthorn (SCH_5200), {0} m a.s.l., {1} m deep": "Schilthorn (SCH_5200), {0} m hoogte, {1} m diep",
