"Data through: sea surface {0}; ocean heat {1}–{2} {3}": "Gegevens t/m: zeeoppervlak {0}; oceaanwarmte {1}–{2} {3}",
"Data through: air temperature {0}; sea surface {1}; ocean heat {2}–{3} {4}; sea level {5} {6}; energy imbalance {7} {8}": "Gegevens t/m: luchttemperatuur {0}; zeeoppervlak {1}; oceaanwarmte {2}–{3} {4}; zeespiegel {5} {6}; energie-onbalans {7} {8}",
